#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:1 d75af6288516439db405f2a34979459d
msgid "Join"
msgstr "连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:3 e1b4997faf6f4a759c8704c2cdaab00f
msgid "Inner Join"
msgstr "内连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:5 ec45ac2d3f1d42458336ca8184391e88
msgid ""
"The relationship in the inner join condition is an equal-quantity "
"relation, returning all data that satisfies the join condition. If no "
"match is found, the query result returns an empty result set."
msgstr ""
"内连接条件中的关系是等量关系，返回满足连接条件的所有数据。如果找不到匹配的"
"数据，查询结果将返回空结果集。"

