#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:38 39bc8a9f94ae439f825a7dff537d924d
msgid "Inner Join (non-equivalent)"
msgstr "内连接（非等价）"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:40 35c39ced57aa4615a03c1aacea174547
msgid ""
"The relationship in the inner join condition is a non-equivalent "
"relationship, returning all data that satisfies the join condition. If no "
"match is found, the query result returns an empty result set."
msgstr ""
"内连接条件中的关系是一种非等价关系，会返回满足连接条件的所有数据。如果找不"
"到匹配数据，查询结果将返回空结果集。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:71 8e48bbefc35c422c953666f9296d8b3a
msgid "Full join"
msgstr "全外连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:73 dc4de6be2cd847ca884004f15a9648d8
msgid ""
"The join table will contain all the records from the two tables. The join "
"statement is equivalent to multiplying the two tables and using the NULL "
"value as the result of missing matches on both sides."
msgstr ""
"连接表将包含两个表中的所有记录。连接语句相当于将两个表相乘，并使用 NULL 值"
"作为双方缺失匹配的结果。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:86 22d08083bd9f4787b92fcc1ec37e60b2
msgid "Result set"
msgstr "结果集"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:105 2d3fe5b3d3a441daa26b5ec5d6151cd2
msgid "Cross join"
msgstr "交叉连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:107 bd6763669eba4a1f81453a5b0fe5125e
msgid "Returns the Cartesian product of joined tables."
msgstr "返回连接表的笛卡尔乘积。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:143 a24f4758ddaa4245a31ab1b83ebd5fd8
msgid "Left join"
msgstr "左连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:145 f2bb300d9ab34070a3d74ab4482aba7c
msgid ""
"Get all records in the left table, even if there is no corresponding "
"matching data in the right table. If no match is found, the query result "
"returns an empty result set."
msgstr ""
"获取左表中的所有记录，即使右表中没有相应的匹配数据。如果未找到匹配数据，查"
"询结果将返回空结果集。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:177 3e041c9dbab94dc5bee66f869076faf4
msgid "Right join"
msgstr "右连接"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_join_function.md:179 665973033aa142f2ad1c165e9893bee5
msgid ""
"Get all the data in the data table on the right, even if there is no "
"corresponding data in the table on the left. If no match is found, the "
"query result returns an empty result set."
msgstr ""
"获取右侧数据表中的所有数据，即使左侧数据表中没有相应的数据。如果未找到匹配"
"数据，查询结果将返回空结果集。"
